      "scope": "per pending or committed_waiting_ack trust record; a BOOT-SCOPED MONOTONIC deadline (creation + 86400 on the current boot's monotonic clock), with a persisted per-boot continuity token: incomplete records are deleted at boot/restart where continuity cannot be proven (OTP2-STA-010c). Client-side mapping (OTP2-STA-010d): the phone's authoritative below-active lifetime bounds the pair; genuinely-pending CLIENT records use a connector-owned monotonic interval (deleted on context loss); the client's durable active-family mirror has NO independent local deadline",
